title: "confsteer-bioemu"
abstract: >-
  TopK sparse autoencoders on BioEmu residue-level representations, and
  bounded-residual adapters that steer the BioEmu denoiser toward named
  conformational states on cryptic-pocket, domain-motion and kinase DFG
  benchmarks.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Authors"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - sparse autoencoder
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - protein structure
  - BioEmu
  - conformational steering
